===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*ženьščina}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*ženьskъ}} + {{m|sla-pro|*-ina}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*žena}} + {{m|sla-pro|*-ьskъ}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|ru|женский|ина}}, from {{suffix|ru|жена|ский}}.

